## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Manual `npm run inngest:dev` background worker alongside preview** — caused port-8288 war (two supervisors); killing the worker's child → it respawned. ROOT of the "both stopped at lunch" stall: I killed the Inngest worker during the port fight → Polina's dispatches went nowhere (no engine) → silent stall. FIX: only `preview_start` manages inngest; never manual bash; never kill the worker.
- **Polina reports «запустила» but job doesn't run** — recurring TD-39: her dispatch gets HTTP 200 (DB write + event emit) but executor never picks up (worker down / fan-out lost) → false success. NOT fixed, only worked around. This is the #1 resume priority.
- **Тео nudge ≠ Polina mutation in Mode 2.5** — Polina correctly refused to execute a mutation from a team-chat auto-trigger; needs Director's verbal «да». So Director nudges+approves; Тео is on-call for bugs.

